cff-version: 1.2.0
title: Adyghe & Kabardian Language Resources
message: >-
  If you use these resources, please cite the individual file you used
  (see its `cite-as` field) and, where relevant, this repository.
type: dataset
authors:
  - given-names: M. Uğur
    family-names: Nemlioğlu
    orcid: https://orcid.org/0000-0002-1969-2356
repository-code: https://github.com/nemerko/ady-kbd-language-resources
url: https://github.com/nemerko/ady-kbd-language-resources
abstract: >-
  Reference material for the Circassian languages Adyghe (ady) and Kabardian
  (kbd): transliteration tables between Cyrillic and Turkish Latin, and related
  documentation. Every character is given with its Unicode codepoint so that the
  palochka (U+04C0 / U+04CF) cannot be confused with the Latin characters
  commonly typed in its place.
keywords:
  - Adyghe
  - Kabardian
  - Circassian
  - transliteration
  - endangered languages
  - language resources
license: CC-BY-4.0
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-08-14
